TweetNaCl (20140427)

Copyright: Daniel J. Bernstein, Bernard van Gastel, Wesley Janssen,
Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe, and Sjaak Smetsers.

This implementation is in the public domain. See https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/
for the original distribution and papers.

Vendored here only for detached Ed25519 signature verification. nextupd does
not generate keys, sign manifests, or use the secret-key APIs. The
randombytes symbol is stubbed in update_signature.c and is never called.
